{"surah":111,"ayahs":["تَبَّتْ يَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">دَآ</span> أَبِى لَهَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">بٍ وَ</span>تَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بَّ</span>","<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_obligatory\">مَآ</span> أَغْنَىٰ عَنْهُ مَالُهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> وَمَا كَسَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بَ</span>","سَيَصْلَىٰ نَا<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ikhafa\">رًا ذَ</span>اتَ لَهَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بٍ</span>","وَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>مْرَأَتُهُ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-madda_normal\">ۥ</span> حَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ghunnah\">مَّ</span>الَةَ <span class=\"tajweed tajweed-ham_wasl\">ٱ</span>لْحَطَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بِ</span>","فِى جِيدِهَا حَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">بْ</span><span class=\"tajweed tajweed-idgham_ghunnah\">لٌ مِّن مَّ</span>سَ<span class=\"tajweed tajweed-qalaqah\">دِۭ</span>"]}